ind":"announcement","title":"Playtest and Demo","summary":"We have concluded the current playtest. Thank you to everyone who participated and shared their feedback—it was incredibly helpful!We are currently preparing a demo version for release and getting ready to participate in Steam Next Fest. We’ve updated the page’s visuals and description and temporarily removed the old trailer; we’ll be announcing a new trailer for the demo soon.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T19:11:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489965","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:45:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4369890-1831432155575475","game_id":"steam-4369890","kind":"announcement","title":"1000 Wishlists!","summary":"We've reached the 1,000+ wishlists, and it's all thanks to you! Thank you for your support and belief in CUP OR DIE!At the moment we are working very hard on the game and preparing for playtest and further demo version.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-03T13:12:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155575475","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:45:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4369890-1830797770239817","game_id":"steam-4369890","kind":"announcement","title":"Registration for the Playtest is open!","summary":"Hello everyone!Playtest registration is open!We're currently working on an early version, which we plan to release for playtesting.We'd love for you to join us and help us test and improve!Thank you all for your support!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-26T08:01:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770239817","verified_at":"2026-10